# item40/item40e: Amos01 route. Player input plus named use/grab of map actors; no teleport,
# set_goal, take_control or weapon grant. Input is ignored by the run while the authored
# cinematics own the controller (intro Cine0, Jones Cine3).
#
# item40e findings (local/reports/item40e-amos01-doorway.md):
#   - Porte14/15 on the office north wall are the sliding panels of a wall cupboard
#     (AMplacar01 + AMplacarport01) on a 384-UU-thick solid BSP wall: there is no doorway.
#   - The office's only player exit is the south door Porte17 (8,-528), a PlayerTriggerToggle
#     XIIIPorte opened by use; opening it fires its OpeningEvent dialamos3tempo.
#   - The ground-floor ducts are entered through breakable floor-level grilles
#     (XIDCine.BreakableMover, AMaeraplaq); the player starts without fists, so a deco pickup
#     (ChaiseDeco -> DecoChair, one swing) breaks a grille.
#
# item40f (local/reports/item40f-amos01-duct.md): the duct is a dead end for the objective
# (BreakAbleMover17's walkable face points out of the duct, item 1) and so is the zone-23
# conference room (the AMtabloreso table's collision is the full 128x128x200 corridor block).
# The authored ground route is the WEST/NORTH loop, measured from the portal graph and
# box-probe sweeps: corridor (zone 22) west -> zone 24 (open boundary y=-544) -> use Porte24
# (-2432,-240) -> zone 15 -> punch the breakable cartons BreakAbleMover44/56 (Fists,
# inventorygroup 0; the chair's single swing is spent on the duct grille) -> duct 14 crawl
# (crouched; BreakableMover9 at the west end faces into the duct, BreakableMover8 at the east
# end faces into the duct) -> zone 19 south -> crouch doorway zone 21 (x=-1269, y 90..218) ->
# zone 17 crawl (crouched, ceiling 128) north: (-1098,145) -> (-1098,421) -> (-1032,425) ->
# (-1033,969) -> (-1018,1891) -> zone 41 -> (-1021,2322) -> (-1021,2704) -> zone 44 ->
# TouchTrigger41 (-1010,3194) fires clabataille (Cine5, opens Porte6) -> (-1022,3367) ->
# zone 45 (44-45 portal y 3316..3444) -> zone 45 west -> Porte6 (45-57 portal y=3600) ->
# zone 57 (Porte7) -> 49 -> 56 -> sliver 59 -> zone 58 ground room -> AMescalier01 switchback
# stairs (StaticMeshActor677) -> landing -> strip stairs to the 53-58 portal (Porte48) ->
# zone 53 -> 52 (porte41/Porte38) -> 43 (Porte35) -> 39 ring -> slope down to zone 7 -> 6 ->
# elevated nav chain 6/8/12/33 -> 32 corridor (y=-1360 band) -> 32-38 portal -> TouchTrigger39
# (-1999,-553,524): objective 1 completes and the map travels to Toits01.
t=0.50 forward 1
t=1.50 forward 0
